  "body": "## What changed\n- dictionary models now store `VINTED_MODEL` / `SEARCH_QUERY`\n- existing models migrate safely to `VINTED_MODEL`\n- dictionary models store optional proposed bot price and expected resale price\n- added a dedicated pricing endpoint that does not mutate bot configuration\n- added **Cennik modeli**: spreadsheet-like, brand-grouped reference price matrix\n- Create Bot now always selects a dictionary model; its target mode is derived automatically\n- SEARCH_QUERY models use the dictionary model name as the Vinted search phrase\n- Create/Edit Bot shows proposed offer, resale price, and indicative difference\n- Edit Bot resolves both VINTED_MODEL and SEARCH_QUERY bots through the dictionary\n\n## Safety\n- changing model name/target semantics still requires affected bots to be STOPPED and without active/action-required negotiations\n- editing reference prices does not alter existing bot strategy or negotiation steps\n- reference prices are informational only; they never auto-fill or submit offers\n- existing dictionary models default to VINTED_MODEL via Flyway migration",
